# Per ADR-023 + v2.0 Phase 2 S2 MUST-FIX, corrected v2.19.16 (D3(a), docs/architecture.md
# ADR-100 D7): supply-chain-critical files are owned by the maintainer below. This repo has
# exactly one collaborator (jmlozano1990) and live branch protection carries
# required_approving_review_count: 0, require_code_owner_reviews: false (verified 2026-08-30) —
# so a rule requiring more than one maintainer's sign-off has never been satisfiable by anyone
# since v2.0. These rows
# route review and make an unreviewed change visible; they do not REQUIRE review and cannot block
# a merge on that basis alone.
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md §Maintainer Review for what actually gates agency-sync PRs (CI checks).

# Supply-chain integrity files — maintainer-owned; see CONTRIBUTING.md for what actually gates
# PRs touching these
