# Release/publish surface — v2.19.7 (AC-E3-1, AC-E3-2, ADR-079/ADR-080). Same
# enforcement-strength caveat as every other row in this file — one clause below
# corrected at v2.19.15 Phase 1 (ADR-099, D5 third living source): the claim that
# `required_status_checks` is absent stops being true once this cycle's gate is armed
# post-merge (`AC-REQCHECK-1`) — several of these same paths (`cowork.lock.json`,
# `.github/workflows/sync-agency.yml`, `.github/workflows/quality.yml`) become covered
